  "boundary":"This programme discovers FDA Product Classification Database records keyed by exact three-letter product code. FDA states that product code and name identify a generic device category. If no regulation number is referenced, the device has not yet been classified and the listed class is proposed rather than final. Classification context does not itself establish exact device identity, marketing authorization, clearance/approval, system conformance, automatic assessment reopening, or UNESCO/institutional endorsement."
